        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See proposed structure at <a href=\"https://github.com/dipikabh/mdn-css-reorg/blob/main/css-tree-proposed.json\">css-tree-proposed.json</a>.</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Created <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/selectors</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/selectors/combinators</code> directories.</li>\n<li>Created listing pages for Selectors (<code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/reference/selectors/index.md</code>) and Combinators (<code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/reference/selectors/combinators/index.md</code>).</li>\n<li>Moved the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">css/pseudo_classes</code> directory under <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/selectors</code>.</li>\n<li>Moved the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">css/pseudo_elements</code> directory under <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/selectors</code>.</li>\n<li>Moved all pages with <code class=\"notranslate\">page-type: css-selector</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">page-type: css-combinator</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">page-type: css-pseudo-class</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">page-type: css-pseudo-element</code> under <code class=\"notranslate\">css/reference/selectors</code>.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\">I've retained the \"_selectors\" suffix in directory names despite the redundancy with the parent <code class=\"notranslate\">selectors/</code> directory. It'll help to quickly distinguish selectors from combinators when browsing the filesystem.</p>\n</div>\n<ol start=\"6\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated paths in the sidebar (<code class=\"notranslate\">files/sidebars/cssref.yaml</code>) for Selectors, Combinators, Pseudo-classes, and Pseudo-elements, and added links for the new listing pages.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Small follow-up to previous <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41746\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41746/hovercard\">PR</a>: Updated <code class=\"notranslate\">page-type</code> in <code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/reference/properties/index.md</code> page. Changed from <code class=\"notranslate\">landing-page</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">listing-page</code>.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">File structure before and after</h3>\n<details>\n<summary>Current structure:</summary>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"files/en-us/web/css/\n.\n.\n├── class_selectors\n.\n├── column_combinator\n.\n.\n├── _colon_-moz-drag-over\n.\n├── _doublecolon_after\n.\n.\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/\n.\n.\n├── class_selectors\n.\n├── column_combinator\n.\n.\n├── _colon_-moz-drag-over\n.\n├── _doublecolon_after\n.\n.\n</code></pre></div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>After the move:</summary>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"files/en-us/web/css/reference/selectors/\n.\n.\n├── class_selectors\n.\n├── column_combinator\n.\n.\n├── _colon_-moz-drag-over\n.\n├── _doublecolon_after\n.\n.\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">files/en-us/web/css/reference/selectors/\n.\n.\n├── class_selectors\n.\n├── column_combinator\n.\n.\n├── _colon_-moz-drag-over\n.\n├── _doublecolon_after\n.\n.\n</code></pre></div>\n</details>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Breadcrumbs after the update</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964353-0893384d-9760-4e33-9712-039a9fe0b68b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ArXHM41djkvcbMRm4aU_sUUEqSkzg0wqGlf-JSWjsgI\"><img width=\"465\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-30 at 9 49 32 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964353-0893384d-9760-4e33-9712-039a9fe0b68b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ArXHM41djkvcbMRm4aU_sUUEqSkzg0wqGlf-JSWjsgI\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 90px;\"></a></kbd></p>\n<details>\n<summary>More breadcrumb screenshots</summary>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964354-46762037-3a4c-4e8d-b027-0f6d42534308.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..zdrBb-vFg4JeaYco75dbvlYicwRRWingmff0mGjSqL8\"><img width=\"465\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-30 at 9 49 11 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964354-46762037-3a4c-4e8d-b027-0f6d42534308.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..zdrBb-vFg4JeaYco75dbvlYicwRRWingmff0mGjSqL8\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 90px;\"></a></kbd></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964351-d1b30a4e-2572-40c3-89c5-b82917826284.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..hZcjAVOpNE11wsI9Cfu2Y1I02XGRJMqHsaK8T7Ocvdo\"><img width=\"465\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-30 at 9 50 00 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964351-d1b30a4e-2572-40c3-89c5-b82917826284.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..hZcjAVOpNE11wsI9Cfu2Y1I02XGRJMqHsaK8T7Ocvdo\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 90px;\"></a></kbd></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964349-8c2cd719-cf98-4adf-9b71-20e15e016888.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3eHPItN1TycIA-FWhKNG2FRRpLtTVdXDd04FcGQ_Mbo\"><img width=\"470\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-30 at 9 50 28 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964349-8c2cd719-cf98-4adf-9b71-20e15e016888.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3eHPItN1TycIA-FWhKNG2FRRpLtTVdXDd04FcGQ_Mbo\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 90px;\"></a></kbd></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964348-84f2d090-26c2-44f9-98bd-07d4c6574175.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..O5ZAWJUcsIPIg-RU2MM1Sfa3EhgsVn84sUw_gdTFVYI\"><img width=\"465\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-30 at 9 51 34 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964348-84f2d090-26c2-44f9-98bd-07d4c6574175.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..O5ZAWJUcsIPIg-RU2MM1Sfa3EhgsVn84sUw_gdTFVYI\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 90px;\"></a></kbd></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964347-fb1577dc-75be-45fd-b561-5900d4bb8809.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..47RNguKiFZWx_Py5GjUsXqnR6dDg6-OHU-x4IBjLeAA\"><img width=\"465\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-30 at 9 51 34 PM\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/507964347-fb1577dc-75be-45fd-b561-5900d4bb8809.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..47RNguKiFZWx_Py5GjUsXqnR6dDg6-OHU-x4IBjLeAA\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 90px;\"></a></kbd></p>\n</details>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3562136397\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41720\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41720/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41720\">#41720</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3565794997\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41735\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41735/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41735\">#41735</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3570605768\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41746\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41746/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41746\">#41746</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Discussion: <a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/256\">https://github.com/orgs/mdn/discussions/256</a><br>\nTracker issue: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2978311041\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/662\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/662/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/662\">mdn/mdn#662</a></p>",
