        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4181003?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've made the text more concise by removing some more subjective phrases and superfluous text. I've also removed links in the related section which I think are not relevant (profile pages and double links to the same page).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is my first submission so please review.</p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Phrases like \"It's also surprisingly easy to work with\", \"already in the format you specify\", and \"data ready for you to do with as you will\" struck me, so I rewrote parts to improve the style. The overall text and structure has been preserved.</p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">none</p>\n\n\n\n",
