        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF145 supports the HTTP headers <code class=\"notranslate\">Activate-Storage-Access</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">Sec-Fetch-Storage-Access</code> in preview in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1991688\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1991688</a> (from 145)</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a simple release note and experimental features. I'm still working on docs, but since I've only got a few days in, wanted the essential thing out first.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510237045\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41499\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41499/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41499\">#41499</a></p>",
