        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Documents the <code class=\"notranslate\">data_collection_permissions</code> property of the <code class=\"notranslate\">gecko</code> sub-key of the manifest key <code class=\"notranslate\">browser_specific_settings</code> introduced by <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1954524\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1954524</a> Add support for data collection permissions in the manifest.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">BCD compatibility changes in PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3545749774\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28276\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28276/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28276\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28276</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41555.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3521217315\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41555\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41555/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41555\">#41555</a></p>",
